1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,680
在香港，難的不是聽懂，而是開口。
The problem isn't understanding Cantonese.
It's having to speak it.

2
00:00:14,523 --> 00:00:19,023
綠色小巴沒有下車鈴，不喊就會坐過站。
A green minibus has no bell.
You shout 「有落」 — or you miss your stop.

3
00:00:35,023 --> 00:00:39,543
全程顯示尚餘多少個站、還有多遠。
On board, it counts the stops
and the distance still to go.

4
00:00:57,023 --> 00:01:01,063
下車那一句連拼音都已寫好。
The line you need, with romanisation —
readable even if you can't speak it.

5
00:01:15,023 --> 00:01:19,723
時間到即震動提示，一按便替你喊出。
It buzzes on the lock screen.
One tap, and it speaks for you.

6
00:01:23,529 --> 00:01:28,929
上車前已知車資，並清楚說明目的地。
Know the fare before you get in —
and say the destination clearly.

7
00:01:35,029 --> 00:01:39,089
偏離路線會提醒你，但不會妄指司機。
If the taxi strays off route it says so —
without accusing anyone.

8
00:01:47,299 --> 00:01:50,379
急症室分五級分流，並非先到先得。
A&E triage runs five levels —
it isn't first come, first served.

9
00:01:54,299 --> 00:01:57,439
講述病情，用你自己的語言即可。
Describe your symptoms
in your own language.

10
00:02:02,299 --> 00:02:07,019
即時轉成廣東話，並附拼音可照讀。
Cantonese back, with romanisation
so you can read it aloud.

11
00:02:15,564 --> 00:02:19,684
茶餐廳最難的，是伙計寫的那些字。
The hard part isn't the food.
It's what the waiter writes.

12
00:02:28,564 --> 00:02:33,584
「0T 走冰 少甜」——廚房看得懂的寫法。
「0T 走冰 少甜」 — the shorthand
the kitchen reads, not a translation.

13
00:02:44,397 --> 00:02:47,597
拍下餐牌，即可直接落單。
Photograph the menu
and order straight off it.

14
00:02:54,397 --> 00:02:59,377
認錯了？可以修改。價錢絕不臆測。
Misread a line? Fix it. We never invent
a price the camera couldn't read.

15
00:03:09,416 --> 00:03:12,396
九種語言，不止中英文。
Nine languages —
not just Chinese and English.

